LICENSING NOTICE
================

This repository contains code developed by Ivine P Sabu as part of the
Industrial Conveyor Vision Analytics project, building on a baseline YOLOv8
detector originally trained by another member of the engineering team using
authorized Muralya Dairy conveyor imagery.

The licensing status of this repository is pending review prior to public
publication. A LICENSE file will be added when the following has been resolved:

  1. Attribution and ownership boundaries between the original baseline
     detector and the engineering work in this repository have been
     formally clarified.

  2. Redistribution rights for any derivative of the baseline detector
     weights have been confirmed.

Until then, this repository is shared for portfolio review purposes only.
No open-source license is granted.

---

Dataset & Media Notice
----------------------
The industrial video footage, conveyor imagery, annotations, and dataset
images captured on-site at Muralya Dairy are proprietary and are NOT
included in or licensed by this repository. They are excluded via .gitignore.
